/-!
# Finite-prefix physical compiler and dual-square ledger for the whole restart run

Every edge of the native whole restart run already carries one actual
positive-time unforced receipt.  This module places those receipts on the
single accumulated physical-time axis generated by `elapsedTime`.

The compiled path uses the exact receipt on each source-owned window and
glues adjacent endpoints literally.  The same windows then carry the
`H¹--H⁻¹` square payment which bounds the complete positive output work.
No restart partition, cutoff, target path, compatibility certificate, or
payment bound is accepted from a caller.
-/

